  "title": "Square — array",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Square — array",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "Square est unaire et élève chaque élément au carré en conservant rang, forme et représentation I32. La variante agrégée utilise explicitement la Simulation privée.\nEntrées : in (array<i32>) = [-3, 0, 4].\nRésultats attendus : result (array<i32>) = [9, 0, 16].\n\nNumeric scalar, array or recursively numeric cluster; result preserves aggregate structure.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: explicit private Simulation; not a compiled-native claim.\nExpected:\noutput-result (array<i32>) = [9, 0, 16]\n",
    "author": "",
    "automatic_versioning": false,
    "program_version": "0.0.0.0",
    "tags": ["numeric-math", "typed-values", "independent-oracle", "explicit-private-simulation", "example"],
    "documentation_uri": ""
  },
